<title>USA: Starwood Lodging acquires Denver hotel.</title>
<headline>Starwood Lodging acquires Denver hotel.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Starwood Lodging Trust, a real-estate investment trust whose shares are paired with those of Starwood Lodging Corp, on Monday said it acquired the 263-room Radisson Hotel Denver South in Denver for $21.75 million.</p>
<p>Starwood Lodging Corp will immediately assume management of the property.</p>
